## Third-party notices

### prompt-master

The prompt optimizer layer in `core/prompt/` (`REGULY.md`, `SZABLONY.md`) is a port of the
substance of `prompt-master` by Nidhin Joseph Nelson (https://github.com/nidhinjs/prompt-master),
used under the MIT License. The material was rewritten in Polish and restructured to the RelAI
document conventions; no source text is reproduced verbatim. Ported on 2026-09-14 from the state
of `main` at that date.

